      preload="metadata" with the poster underneath, and the home grid's card
      clips use preload="none" plus a CONTINUOUS IntersectionObserver that
      pauses off-screen tiles. If a future page renders more than one hero, or
      puts a hero on the same view as the card grid, re-measure before shipping.

