with profile SVG, 8-item gear checklist, 4 route stages, 3-day itinerary,
time-stamped wellness schedule.

**Verified:** 5 cards, all five images resolving, uniform 544px. Per-card fire
1144/1128/1141/1145/1146ms. Single fling past all five -> all open. Partial
rewind to card 2 -> `RO RO -- -- --`. Back to top -> all clear. Panel computed
style rgba(0,0,0,0.6) + blur(12px) on all five. `tsc` clean, no dangling
