conditions on purpose. Tying scale to `revealed` would leave every tile on a
phone permanently scaled up.

**Zero layout shift by construction:** the panel animates height inside a
fixed-height tile, so an opening panel cannot shove its neighbours. Tile
heights held at 340 with a panel open.

