STAR RATINGS: a new token, --color-smaya-gold-star (#a8842a)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A five-star row is a graphical object carrying information, so WCAG 1.4.11 asks
3:1 of it. `--color-smaya-gold` measured 2.10:1 on the white testimonial card
and 2.08:1 on the ivory home card — the rating was the least legible element on
a card whose entire purpose is that rating. The `role="img"` +
